    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to Wishlist, begin your Three Kingdoms journey!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bTo all generals following <i>Code of Three Kingdoms</i>:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We're honored to meet you here! Add to Wishlist and begin your Three Kingdoms journey!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bThe current store video showcases our first demo test footage \u2013 captured through virtual green screen technology and rendered via Unreal Engine 5. The full game is now in production, so stay tuned for more epic updates!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code name: Three Kingdoms &quot;is a fully dynamic live action interactive video work. You will travel back in the first person to the Three Kingdoms era, encounter various generals, meet beautiful women, use strategy to personally participate in solving major historical events and making decisions, allowing you to have the ultimate experience of reaching the peak of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412900/extras/ac4afa5ae0ed85b808b58b476512e378.avif?t=1746536789\" data-has-big width=800 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your every choice not only concerns your personal destiny, but also profoundly affects the people around you and the changes in the overall landscape of the Three Kingdoms era. Between justice and evasion, in the consideration of gains and losses, in the face of power and temptation, under mission and responsibility, you constantly search for your own answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412900/extras/b6a1c5ca104ce35fb8d3155dc9f94291.avif?t=1746536789\" data-has-big width=800 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Product Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that in 'Code Name: Three Kingdoms', players will not only experience a single love, but also have deeper cultural heritage, more strategic decision-making, and a more magnificent historical accumulation. Presenting players with more exciting works in terms of visual perception, music sound effects, emotional immersion, and other aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412900/extras/ecfb85bdfa92962f9d3034b94b594285.avif?t=1746536789\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Design Drawing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412900/extras/8523e78c239c26dd6a2d0ed5c8d2a3db.avif?t=1746536789\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Design Drawing</p>",
