ata-has-big width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Design Drawing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412900/extras/8523e78c239c26dd6a2d0ed5c8d2a3db.avif?t=1746536789\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b3 Design Drawing</p>",
